WEBVTT

00:00:02.853 --> 00:00:07.015
CANDY CANDY

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:15.159
Sobakasu nante kinishinai wa.

00:00:15.777 --> 00:00:21.387
Hana pecha datte datte datte oki ni iri.

00:00:22.047 --> 00:00:25.385
Otenba itazura daisuki,

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:28.652
Kakekko sukippu daisuki;

00:00:28.687 --> 00:00:33.866
Watashi wa, watashi wa, watashi wa Candy!

00:00:34.948 --> 00:00:41.085
Hitoripocchi de iru to choppiri samishii.

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:47.112
Sonna toki kou iu no kagami wo mitsumete:

00:00:47.147 --> 00:00:53.362
Waratte, waratte, waratte Candy!

00:00:53.397 --> 00:00:56.116
Nakibeso nante sayonara!

00:00:56.151 --> 00:00:59.429
Nee, Candy Candy!

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:10.596
The dance where I met him.

00:01:14.008 --> 00:01:15.985
The day for the party is finally here.

00:01:16.099 --> 00:01:20.358
However, Candy had no dress for
the party.

00:01:20.775 --> 00:01:25.821
However, since she was invited, Candy decided
to go to the party dressed as she was,

00:01:25.856 --> 00:01:28.723
even though she was well aware that her
dress was hardly appropriate.

00:01:36.413 --> 00:01:40.351
How is she not embarassed of being seen
wearing that thing at the party?

00:01:41.172 --> 00:01:43.949
Does it matter?
She didn't want your dress, anyway.

00:01:44.808 --> 00:01:46.955
Maybe so.

00:01:47.616 --> 00:01:50.490
I want to meet Anthony!

00:01:51.341 --> 00:01:55.066
Tell me, what will Anthony
think about this dress?

00:01:55.101 --> 00:01:59.238
My, my, if he's anything like you,
he won't get his eyes off you.

00:01:59.273 --> 00:02:01.338
Is it wrong?
I like him!

00:02:01.766 --> 00:02:05.955
The boy whom Eliza likes is called Anthony?
I wonder what he's like.

00:02:06.146 --> 00:02:07.044
Candy.

00:02:07.079 --> 00:02:08.061
Yes?

00:02:08.290 --> 00:02:13.594
Candy, the grand aunt Elroy of the Adley
family is extremely insistent on courtesy.

00:02:13.882 --> 00:02:17.502
If you somehow stand out during the party,
we will send you back immediately.

00:02:22.646 --> 00:02:23.727
This road...!

00:02:25.263 --> 00:02:28.481
This road... it leads to the rose gates!

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:31.041
...the place where I met the Prince...

00:02:42.139 --> 00:02:43.813
The rose gates are open now!

00:02:43.848 --> 00:02:45.919
The gates which were always closed!

00:02:50.765 --> 00:02:52.341
Wow, wonderful!

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:56.895
This residesnce looks like a castle!

00:02:57.714 --> 00:02:59.906
I don't belong in this place, at all.

00:03:00.769 --> 00:03:02.483
And besides, I...

00:03:08.992 --> 00:03:10.149
Hello, Candy!

00:03:10.594 --> 00:03:12.165
Hey, miss tomboy!

00:03:13.036 --> 00:03:15.877
Stear and Archie!

00:03:16.112 --> 00:03:18.286
I knew you would come!

00:03:18.652 --> 00:03:20.231
You too?

00:03:20.922 --> 00:03:22.987
You invited her as well?

00:03:23.192 --> 00:03:25.319
Great minds think alike!

00:03:29.828 --> 00:03:32.135
Welcome.

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:34.251
Grand aunt Elroy is waiting for you.

00:03:34.673 --> 00:03:36.411
Thanks.

00:03:37.669 --> 00:03:39.016
Where is Anthony?

00:03:39.393 --> 00:03:40.538
Over there.

00:03:41.006 --> 00:03:44.383
Is that so? Anthony? Anthony!

00:03:44.418 --> 00:03:46.118
Eliza, don't run.

00:03:51.010 --> 00:03:53.264
-Welcome, Candy!
-We've been waiting for you.

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:58.714
What's the matter, Candy?

00:03:59.639 --> 00:04:00.852
I...

00:04:00.887 --> 00:04:02.247
It's not like you!

00:04:02.644 --> 00:04:06.243
We'll escort you.
Give me your hand!

00:04:06.662 --> 00:04:10.724
Stear and Archie don't seem to mind
the way I'm dressed...

00:04:10.759 --> 00:04:13.036
I'm glad I came, after all!

00:04:14.389 --> 00:04:18.004
That's the spirit.
You're cute when you smile!

00:04:21.058 --> 00:04:22.930
The Prince!

00:04:25.180 --> 00:04:28.116
I thought I might happen to meet him but...

00:04:28.151 --> 00:04:31.633
...but...to really meet him...

00:04:36.114 --> 00:04:40.181
I didn't think I'd see you here!
We thought you'd come by later.

00:04:40.312 --> 00:04:43.851
Anthony? What are you doing?

00:04:43.886 --> 00:04:45.526
Anthony?!

00:04:46.147 --> 00:04:47.563
This person is...

00:04:48.204 --> 00:04:54.285
My prince is...
...Anthony whom Eliza likes...

00:04:55.341 --> 00:04:58.449
This can't be...

00:05:02.454 --> 00:05:05.921
My name is Anthony.
Anthony Brown.

00:05:05.956 --> 00:05:08.460
I'm Candice White.

00:05:08.991 --> 00:05:10.525
She is our servant.

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:15.057
That's not true! I came to the Leagan
family as Eliza's playmate.

00:05:15.331 --> 00:05:18.805
At first, yes. But now you're
my servant.

00:05:20.845 --> 00:05:25.045
If I knew you're in the Leagan family,
I'd invite you over, too.

00:05:26.869 --> 00:05:29.717
Sorry! We did that before you!

00:05:30.372 --> 00:05:35.453
Really? Since she was officially invited, she is
a guest just like Eliza and everyone else!

00:05:39.332 --> 00:05:40.786
Thank you.

00:05:41.426 --> 00:05:45.015
Anthony, how come you know Candy?

00:05:45.924 --> 00:05:50.251
I don't... I saw her at the rose gates
a few days back.

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:54.112
That's not true! We met
much earlier, haven't we?

00:05:54.726 --> 00:05:56.333
At the Pony's hill.

00:06:06.526 --> 00:06:10.160
Party is about to begin.
Please gather inside before dinner.

00:06:13.864 --> 00:06:17.984
To all members of the Adley family;
welcome.

00:06:25.089 --> 00:06:29.605
That person is grand aunt Elroy?
She is scary.

00:06:30.686 --> 00:06:35.166
I decided to move to this estate
in order to live with my grandchildren,

00:06:35.167 --> 00:06:37.188
with whom I spent very little time so far.

00:06:38.735 --> 00:06:44.228
I would like to give my best regards
to my three sweet grandchildren.

00:06:51.811 --> 00:06:54.112
Oh? Where are they?

00:06:55.992 --> 00:06:58.180
Some grandchildren I have!

00:06:59.467 --> 00:07:04.662
All of us, who are living in in this
estate, and grandfather William's...

00:07:04.663 --> 00:07:09.062
Candy!
I promised that I'll escort you.

00:07:09.923 --> 00:07:12.020
Archie...
What's with that suit?

00:07:12.055 --> 00:07:13.700
Everyone's suits are too formal.

00:07:14.331 --> 00:07:16.403
Don't tell me you did this for me...

00:07:16.438 --> 00:07:18.295
I didn't. Come with me!

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:24.604
...and it rised quite an uproar. An enormous
amout uf luggage was transported...

00:07:24.639 --> 00:07:28.584
Anyway, you wouldn't be able to hide
if you were wearing a lady's dress!

00:07:38.347 --> 00:07:40.181
This is great!

00:07:41.714 --> 00:07:43.124
Won't you eat, too?

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:51.714
There's no stopping great aunt Elroy
once she starts rambling!

00:07:52.598 --> 00:07:53.686
Archie!

00:07:55.125 --> 00:07:57.042
Who laughed?

00:08:02.969 --> 00:08:04.278
It was me.

00:08:05.532 --> 00:08:07.289
Candy!

00:08:08.624 --> 00:08:10.443
Who is that girl?

00:08:10.478 --> 00:08:14.056
Aunt Elroy, I am very sorry.
She is one of our servants.

00:08:14.724 --> 00:08:17.556
And what is a servant doing in here?

00:08:17.707 --> 00:08:22.362
We brought that girl along because
Stear and Archie officially invited her.

00:08:22.397 --> 00:08:23.745
My grandchildren?

00:08:23.976 --> 00:08:27.174
In that case, why did you allow her
to come in such casual clothes?

00:08:27.237 --> 00:08:30.441
...just what were they thinking...
...they don't know the party dress code...

00:08:30.964 --> 00:08:35.826
Only you are standing out. Here, look around.
There is nobody else dressed that way.

00:08:37.017 --> 00:08:39.649
That's not true, aunt.

00:08:42.385 --> 00:08:44.592
You two!

00:08:45.140 --> 00:08:50.214
Aunt, we are sorry.
The girl was laughing at me!

00:08:50.249 --> 00:08:54.116
Archie, your face...!
Don't be so careless!

00:08:56.562 --> 00:08:59.168
Aunt, try to be more relaxed!

00:09:00.634 --> 00:09:03.864
Well then, I propose a toast to
health of our grand aunt!

00:09:03.899 --> 00:09:04.948
Cheers!

00:09:08.046 --> 00:09:11.602
I surrender to you guys!
We'll continue later on.

00:09:11.637 --> 00:09:12.920
Now, the dinner.

00:09:19.448 --> 00:09:22.335
The Leagans were ridiculed because of her!

00:09:23.033 --> 00:09:25.710
I won't forgive her.
Where'd she go, anyway?

00:09:25.745 --> 00:09:29.344
Thank you... You all changed
your clothes because of me.

00:09:29.379 --> 00:09:33.479
We're the ones to apologize!
We invited you without much thought.

00:09:34.193 --> 00:09:38.406
No, I really appreciate it!
It looks almost as if we are in a castle.

00:09:40.751 --> 00:09:43.155
It's almost as if I were dreaming.

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:48.796
What are we going to do?
Tell her? Anthony?

00:09:48.797 --> 00:09:49.900
Maybe.

00:09:49.901 --> 00:09:50.879
What?

00:09:51.042 --> 00:09:52.192
What is it?

00:09:52.227 --> 00:09:55.583
You know... there is a
scary room in this house!

00:09:56.076 --> 00:09:57.546
With ghosts and all?

00:09:57.982 --> 00:10:03.300
Yes. At night, there are ghosts in there.
The ghosts of the Adley warriors.

00:10:04.228 --> 00:10:06.643
When the southern clock tower strikes ten...

00:10:10.008 --> 00:10:12.796
...the light goes on in an empty room!

00:10:12.831 --> 00:10:16.626
With a top hat and a black mantle,
he goes around for a walk.

00:10:16.894 --> 00:10:20.841
"I won't let you go...", he says...
He won't let anybody go!

00:10:20.876 --> 00:10:24.387
That's right. The ghost's footsteps keep
echoing in the hallway...

00:10:24.422 --> 00:10:30.208
...tap...tap...tap...

00:10:35.630 --> 00:10:38.160
You're lying, aren't you?

00:10:38.195 --> 00:10:41.664
Sorry!
Candy, I'm really sorry.

00:10:41.699 --> 00:10:44.250
Cheer up, the dance is about to begin.

00:10:44.686 --> 00:10:46.946
I'd like to talk to you and Anthony.

00:10:46.981 --> 00:10:47.704
What about?

00:10:47.739 --> 00:10:49.387
Come to my room.

00:10:50.361 --> 00:10:52.263
We'll be back soon, then.

00:11:04.155 --> 00:11:08.899
If she shows up at the dance wearing that,
everybody will laugh at us Leagans.

00:11:08.934 --> 00:11:11.680
Let's throw her out of this place.

00:11:12.163 --> 00:11:14.993
You can't do that while Stear and Archie
are following her.

00:11:15.433 --> 00:11:17.914
However, I have a good idea.

00:11:19.566 --> 00:11:26.342
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
This is the last "scratchy" episode. Sorry for the
wobbly translation in this ep, I'm tired as hell.

00:11:26.895 --> 00:11:28.534
Here it is!

00:11:30.572 --> 00:11:33.142
Archie... that's...

00:11:33.177 --> 00:11:36.883
Of course, since I knew she'd be coming,
I bought this for Candy!

00:11:37.712 --> 00:11:40.545
Then, why didn't you show it sooner?

00:11:40.919 --> 00:11:44.896
I wanted everyone to be surprised, when she
shows herself dressed like this at the party!

00:11:48.839 --> 00:11:49.948
Candy?

00:11:51.384 --> 00:11:52.875
My head hurts.

00:11:54.615 --> 00:11:58.202
Won't you prepare a bed for me in the bedroom?

00:11:58.435 --> 00:12:00.217
Yes, okay!

00:12:01.543 --> 00:12:04.997
It's the last room on the third floor!
I'll bring eliza in a minute.

00:12:05.032 --> 00:12:06.076
I understand!

00:12:10.515 --> 00:12:12.913
The last room on the third floor...?

00:12:20.823 --> 00:12:22.891
Wearing a top hat and a black mantle...

00:12:35.319 --> 00:12:37.412
Hey, they're just puppets!

00:12:42.008 --> 00:12:44.211
But they look just like real people!

00:12:45.765 --> 00:12:50.254
A whole line of Adleys...
...they said, ancient warriors, huh?

00:12:50.255 --> 00:12:52.496
But I don't like this.

00:12:52.948 --> 00:12:55.436
That must be it!
That room.

00:13:08.263 --> 00:13:09.474
Eliza!

00:13:09.509 --> 00:13:14.279
I'll let you out an hour later!
So stay quiet until I let you out!

00:13:14.525 --> 00:13:17.213
Open up!
Let me out!

00:13:17.248 --> 00:13:19.854
And watch out for ghosts!

00:13:27.860 --> 00:13:28.950
Look at this.

00:13:29.687 --> 00:13:32.012
I guess... this one is
for Candy, too?

00:13:33.030 --> 00:13:34.028
That's right.

00:13:34.900 --> 00:13:37.766
Brothers think alike, right?

00:13:37.801 --> 00:13:41.309
I'm sorry, but that dress
is way too big for Candy!

00:13:41.344 --> 00:13:42.227
No way...?

00:13:43.517 --> 00:13:47.943
You'd better leave
these things to Archie!

00:13:47.978 --> 00:13:51.522
I knew her exact sizes the
moment I saw her!

00:13:52.380 --> 00:13:57.178
Archie, I can't let you be the
only one to give nice things to Candy!

00:13:57.213 --> 00:14:04.028
Come on, don't fight. Why don't you try
to join two dresses together?

00:14:04.063 --> 00:14:07.952
Okay, that way, I could still
give my dress to Candy.

00:14:07.987 --> 00:14:11.111
Okay! In that case, leave
the rest to me!

00:14:11.513 --> 00:14:15.343
If you really can do that, then let
me be the one to tell it to Candy.

00:14:16.352 --> 00:14:17.372
See you!

00:14:23.412 --> 00:14:24.281
Eliza!

00:14:24.877 --> 00:14:26.326
Anthony!

00:14:26.361 --> 00:14:27.381
Where is Candy?

00:14:28.397 --> 00:14:32.118
I don't know. The dance is about to begin,
won't you dance with me?

00:14:33.281 --> 00:14:34.690
Where'd she go...?

00:14:34.915 --> 00:14:37.412
Don't mind Candy!

00:14:39.242 --> 00:14:43.302
She is here for the first time, so she
might have gotten lost. I'll look for her!

00:14:44.179 --> 00:14:45.926
He's not gonna find her!

00:15:03.189 --> 00:15:05.485
Help me!

00:15:14.272 --> 00:15:16.872
Help me! Help me!

00:15:20.665 --> 00:15:23.222
I think I heard a sound coming from here...

00:15:27.236 --> 00:15:29.013
The dance begun already.

00:15:43.399 --> 00:15:45.410
Where did she go?

00:15:49.838 --> 00:15:53.359
Let me out!
Somebody let me out!

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:02.299
Anthony! Dance with me!

00:16:15.957 --> 00:16:18.425
Hey, Archie! Are you done already?

00:16:19.432 --> 00:16:22.362
Dance will be over before you
get this done!

00:16:23.767 --> 00:16:25.765
Now we wouldn't want that to happen!

00:16:33.934 --> 00:16:37.940
The clock...
That's...the southern tower!

00:16:38.577 --> 00:16:41.398
"When the southern clock tower strikes ten..."

00:16:45.587 --> 00:16:47.126
It's ten'o'clock.

00:16:47.986 --> 00:16:51.019
"...the light goes on in an empty room!"

00:16:51.054 --> 00:16:55.409
"With a top hat and a black mantle,
he goes around for a walk."

00:16:55.444 --> 00:16:58.831
Somebody!
Help me!

00:17:32.948 --> 00:17:34.837
A ghost!

00:17:56.694 --> 00:17:58.567
Candy? Candy?

00:17:59.768 --> 00:18:01.079
Anthony?

00:18:03.330 --> 00:18:04.682
Anthony!

00:18:04.968 --> 00:18:06.897
What are you doing in such a place?

00:18:07.563 --> 00:18:11.038
It's here... when the clock struck ten - -

00:18:11.073 --> 00:18:13.561
...it started to pace around!

00:18:13.879 --> 00:18:15.681
Just what are you talking about?

00:18:15.716 --> 00:18:17.526
About a ghost!

00:18:18.470 --> 00:18:22.420
But that's just a story.
The dance is beginning.

00:18:28.722 --> 00:18:29.797
Found her.

00:18:30.244 --> 00:18:31.786
Where were you?

00:18:32.008 --> 00:18:34.921
I found her wandering on the third floor.

00:18:34.956 --> 00:18:37.228
Now, Candy, put this on!

00:18:38.255 --> 00:18:40.289
Wow, it's beautiful!

00:18:40.949 --> 00:18:43.246
Is this... for me?

00:18:43.745 --> 00:18:45.646
These are mother's memento.

00:18:45.899 --> 00:18:48.014
I'll borrow them to you, so
please take them.

00:19:03.171 --> 00:19:05.239
Ca-Candy!

00:19:05.853 --> 00:19:07.935
How did she come out?

00:19:14.511 --> 00:19:18.109
It's wonderful. Am I dreaming?

00:19:18.661 --> 00:19:21.847
If it's a dream,
I never want to wake up.

00:19:22.065 --> 00:19:24.209
Candy, it's not a dream.

00:19:25.084 --> 00:19:28.188
It's true? It's really true, isn't it?

00:19:35.185 --> 00:19:39.491
Anthony, I wanted to ask you before but...

00:19:39.996 --> 00:19:40.980
What was it?

00:19:41.223 --> 00:19:42.907
Do you know about Pony's hill?

00:19:43.299 --> 00:19:44.824
Pony's hill?

00:19:50.505 --> 00:19:51.523
I don't.

00:19:54.259 --> 00:19:55.101
But...

00:19:56.931 --> 00:19:59.125
It's my turn now!

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:04.360
I wonder why Anthony said that
he doesn't know about Pony's hill.

00:20:04.395 --> 00:20:08.077
But I don't care. It's not going
to change my Prince in any way.

00:20:14.583 --> 00:20:16.028
I'm sorry!

00:20:17.018 --> 00:20:19.541
You were better while you danced with Anthony!

00:20:19.762 --> 00:20:22.370
Don't complain!
It's my turn now!

00:20:24.724 --> 00:20:28.315
To bring a servant to a party...

00:20:28.350 --> 00:20:31.175
Madam Leagan is such a gentle person.

00:20:31.526 --> 00:20:35.263
Darling? Have you heard what
everybody was saying?

00:20:35.618 --> 00:20:38.380
Candy made us look caring.

00:20:38.876 --> 00:20:44.255
No. Even though everybody was saying that,
deep inside they were condemning the idea.

00:20:44.813 --> 00:20:48.029
What we brought with ourselves
is this pure girl.

00:20:48.064 --> 00:20:51.831
And even the great aunt is
looking at her like that.

00:21:02.206 --> 00:21:05.963
In any case, this can't go on
for too long.

00:21:06.026 --> 00:21:08.698
Archie's lucid expression...

00:21:09.134 --> 00:21:11.802
...and the mischievous spark in
Stear's eyes...

00:21:12.090 --> 00:21:17.580
But... when I'm dancing with Anthony,
I remember the light breeze from the hill.

00:21:17.615 --> 00:21:22.465
The breeze that grew so much gentler
from the time when I met the Prince.

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:25.971
I can forgive Neil and Eliza.

00:21:26.605 --> 00:21:30.943
Sister Pony, sister Lane!
I'm so happy right now!

00:21:31.447 --> 00:21:35.776
This was Candy's first party.

00:21:35.811 --> 00:21:38.912
To be continued...

00:21:44.891 --> 00:21:52.962
Ashita wa doko kara
umarete kuru no

00:21:52.997 --> 00:22:02.088
Watashi wa, ashita ga,
ashita ga suki.

00:22:02.494 --> 00:22:11.032
Suteki na koto ga
ari sore

00:22:11.067 --> 00:22:20.139
Watashi wa, ashita ga
ashita ga suki.

00:22:20.535 --> 00:22:28.486
Kirakira hikaru
Kaze no mukou de

00:22:28.521 --> 00:22:39.212
Ano hito ga watashi wo
Watashi wo yondeiru - -

00:22:39.247 --> 00:22:49.985
Candy, Candy, Candy, Candy.
